// A scenario decided in the kernel (spec 013.4, the chain): its phrases are a sub-chain
// forked from the record at its point, its end state is checked for the invariant, and
// the configuration is restored (011.11), so the claim after it sees the state before it.
Fact p Identified by P, Q.
+p(P).
Invariant inv When p(P).
Scenario adds-q {
  ?!p(Q).
  +p(Q).
  ?p(Q).
  ?p(P).
}
?!p(Q).
Scenario still-absent {
  ?!p(Q).
}
